## Properties confirmed

All 18 §2.3 tags with the specified kinds and arities; §2.4 saturation one-way; §2.5 exclusions (`:eid`, `:macro?`, `:yang/*`, symbol metadata on names, reader positions in payloads at every depth); §4.4 sharing by address with a loud collision on the encoder's scalar-metadata residual; §7.2 round-trip law in both directions over a corpus covering every tag; MapEntry, list, set, and map payload types preserved.

## Verdict

**APPROVE-WITH-FINDINGS (nonblocking).** Safe to commit on `dao.stream-redesign-v2`. Conditions before merge to master: the CLJD run, and the docstring correction on `semantic-bytecode->ast`. The other three findings are tracked follow-ups.
